Since you needed an altar for holy water, you must have had ordinary 
water. You may have had a scroll of remove curse, and a means of 
confusing yourself. You could have read the scroll while confused (look 
up the scroll spoiler for the details), to change the water into 
approximately 1/4 holy and 1/4 unholy water.

This trick is often reccommended to make unholy water, but of course, 
the opposite sometimes comes in handy, as well.

